### Turn 1 — greeting (no tool call)

**User:** `Hi, can you help me with something?`

Per `generation.py`'s system prompt ("Do NOT use the tool for: greetings, casual conversation,
unrelated questions"), Gemini answers directly without calling `search_judgments`.

```json
