  "query": "Hi, can you help me with something?",
  "answer": "Hello! I'm a research assistant for Sindh High Court judgments. I can help you look up specific cases, citations, judges, or legal questions related to this corpus. What would you like to know?",
  "tool_used": null,
  "results": []
}
```

