### Turn 4 — topic shift to a new legal question (new tool call)

**User:** `Separately, can you find cases about security being furnished to release a vessel?`

"Separately" signals a topic shift, so Gemini invokes `search_judgments` again with a new query,
per §5.3 ("If the user shifts topic to a new legal question, the LLM invokes the tool again").

